sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Census
    participant VB as VendorBenchmarkProvider
    participant BR as Bridge
    participant AR as Authority Resolver
    participant O as Oracle Projection
    participant L as SOTA Lab
    participant E as Evaluator

    C->>VB: Inspect provider family
    VB-->>C: Shared constructor + materialization authority requirements
    C->>L: Classify oracle semantics
    L->>BR: Apply generic constructor introspection
    BR->>AR: MaterializationIntent(authority_ref)
    AR-->>BR: ADMITTED / REFUSED
    alt Refused or dependency blocked
        BR-->>L: Typed blocker
    else Materialized
        BR->>O: Bind evaluator semantics
        alt Category A reward-file
            O-->>L: Shared reward-file oracle + config
        else Category B exit-code
            O-->>L: Shared exit-code oracle + config
        else Category C JSON-field
            O-->>L: Shared JSON-field oracle + config
        else Category D in-process evaluator
            O-->>L: Requires new evaluator capability shape
        else Category E no oracle
            O-->>L: Permanent refusal boundary
        end
        L->>E: Execute only authority-safe admitted benchmark
        E-->>L: Score / failure / typed blocker
    end
